1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:02,300
Oops. He doesn't want friends.

2
00:00:02,700 --> 00:00:10,800
Your ship sinks…
and you wash up on an island full of monkeys.

3
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:16,800
Pick a role: warrior, hunter,
mage or medic.

4
00:00:17,200 --> 00:00:26,800
Chop, eat, craft and build.
The monkeys won't wait!

5
00:00:27,200 --> 00:00:36,800
At night the red moon rises…
and they all come.

6
00:00:37,200 --> 00:00:41,800
Four bosses. Zero mercy.

7
00:00:47,200 --> 00:00:51,800
Freeze him!

8
00:00:52,200 --> 00:00:56,800
Lava? Of course!

9
00:00:57,200 --> 00:01:02,800
Make furry friends…

10
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:08,800
…then ride them.

11
00:01:09,200 --> 00:01:16,800
Love the island? Stay.
Your plot grows every day.

12
00:01:17,200 --> 00:01:21,800
Rather beat your friends?
Steal their flag…

13
00:01:22,200 --> 00:01:25,800
…sink the ball…

14
00:01:26,200 --> 00:01:30,800
…or blast them in the lab.

15
00:01:31,200 --> 00:01:34,800
Had enough? Call for rescue!

16
00:01:35,200 --> 00:01:39,800
Bring your friends!
